From: rigaz29 <ryanbagas27@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 20:48:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/8] DownloadManager: tambahkan pauseDownload, resumeDownload,
 PAUSED_MANUAL

DownloadProvider lineage-24.0 memakai ketiganya di TrampolineActivity, tapi
tak satu pun dideklarasikan di DownloadManager:

  TrampolineActivity.java:115  cannot find symbol  pauseDownload(long)
  TrampolineActivity.java:122  cannot find symbol  resumeDownload(long)
  TrampolineActivity.java:124  cannot find symbol  PAUSED_MANUAL

Keduanya di HEAD hulu masing-masing (DownloadProvider d60d5fc0), jadi celah
hulu yang menghadang perangkat LineageOS 24.0 mana pun.

Seluruh 24 anggota DownloadManager yang dipakai TrampolineActivity disisir
sekaligus: tepat tiga yang hilang.

Diimplementasikan SUNGGUHAN, bukan stub, karena infrastrukturnya memang sudah
ada di android.provider.Downloads.Impl:
  CONTROL_PAUSED / CONTROL_RUN   (:542, :547)
  STATUS_PAUSED_BY_APP           (:631)

Polanya menyalin restartDownload di berkas yang sama: query dulu untuk
memvalidasi status, lempar IllegalArgumentException kalau tidak sesuai, lalu
update lewat ContentResolver dengan helper getWhereClauseForIds yang sudah ada.

PAUSED_MANUAL bernilai 5, meneruskan dari PAUSED_UNKNOWN = 4.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014jmPZUGK9WfRiXSD8axwCp
Change-Id: Iffaf09550d806ce3bf491fb78596d2bcfefc28dc
---
 core/java/android/app/DownloadManager.java | 67 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 67 insertions(+)

diff --git a/core/java/android/app/DownloadManager.java b/core/java/android/app/DownloadManager.java
index c12f48c1c0c1..64012fcef80e 100644
--- a/core/java/android/app/DownloadManager.java
+++ b/core/java/android/app/DownloadManager.java
@@ -301,6 +301,15 @@ public class DownloadManager {
      */
     public final static int PAUSED_UNKNOWN = 4;
 
+    /**
+     * [A37] Value of {@link #COLUMN_REASON} when the download is paused because
